## Rendering table within quarto documents


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(gt)
```
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
iris |&gt; gt() |&gt;   tab_header(
    title = "Iris dataset from fisher & Anderson",
    subtitle = md("`iris` is an R dataset")
  ) |&gt;   data_color(
    columns = Species,
    method = "factor",
    palette = "viridis"
  )
```

